  'set.subPageSupportHelp': 'Links allowed: text(https://…) shows only the text; half- or full-width parentheses, and a space before them is fine. The link text runs back from the parenthesis to the nearest punctuation, link or auto-detected handle. Tg: @username and WhatsApp: +number become clickable links automatically.',
